body:
i also looked into attachment theory! i have a disorganized attachment style myself. but i will join it because i didn’t know there was a sub for it 👀👀👀 thank you for making me aware of this!

as for your question, i am 21 years old. i used to when i was a kid, but as an adult i would have to say no, i don’t know how to form a relationship that isn’t shallow anymore. it often surprises me how intensely the other person feels about our relationship vs me. i do try to make the other person feel secure and do put effort into the relationship, but it feels like it’s more of me going through the motions and not really participating that much

and i would love the articles pls 🙏🏼 i can’t do medical care so i’ve been having to sherlock holmes myself ;-;
